WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/components/ai/AISafetySettingExplainer.tsx — the Helix safety-setting explainer card. It is
  `withAiFeature('safety-setting-explainer', InnerSection)` (a `useAiEnabled` gate; disabled => the
  HOC renders `null`, carrying data-testid "ai-feature-safety-setting-explainer-root"). InnerSection:
    • `body = useMemo(() => ({}), [])`  — the EMPTY object (no vehicle_id, no days); the backend reads
      the user identity from the ForwardAuth subject and applies a deterministic default question;
    • `useAiStream({ url: '/ai/settings/safety/explain', body, onEvent: noop })` — NARRATIVE render
      contract: the no-op onEvent never copies a typed tool_result into a form; Helix only EXPLAINS the
      user's existing safety settings, never proposes/changes a value, never offers an Apply handoff;
    • `cancel()` runs on unmount (dedicated cleanup effect with explicit cancelStream dep);
    • `isBusy = state === 'streaming' || state === 'paused-confirm'`; `handleExplain` no-ops while busy
      (double-submit guard), else `stream.start()`;
    • renders the shared `AIFeatureCard` with
        title       t('safetySettings.aiExplainer.title','Explain my safety settings'),
        description t('safetySettings.aiExplainer.description', <typed-envelope/PII-safe/narrate-only>),
        buttonLabel t('safetySettings.aiExplainer.button','Explain my settings'),
        badgeLabel  t('safetySettings.aiExplainer.badge','Helix'),
        canStart   = stream.state !== 'paused-confirm'  (the ONLY gate — there is no input precondition),
        onAction   = handleExplain, buttonPlacement = 'below',
        buttonTestId = 'ai-feature-safety-setting-explainer-suggest'.

  Composed shared primitives reproduced for parity (their native atoms are owned by the P4 component-
  library bundle — out of scope here — so they are reproduced as private subviews scoped to this
  surface, the only files this prompt may touch):
    • AIFeatureCard  : GlassPanel -> (title + AIBadge) -> description -> universal "Ask Helix" button
                       (idle "Ask Helix" / streaming "Helix is thinking…"; disabled = !canStart ||
                       isStreaming; aria-label "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}") -> AiOutputPanel.
    • AiOutputPanel  : nothing while idle+empty; "Helix error: {message}" in error; AIThinkingIndicator
                       (shimmer lines + dots) while streaming before the first delta; else the prose.
                       hasAnything = text>0 || streaming || error || done  (paused-confirm without text
                       => empty; with text => prose).
    • useAiStream    : idle -> streaming -> (done | error); `confirm_request` -> paused-confirm; delta
                       frames accumulate; a non-OK HTTP response finalises as "stream_http_{status}";
                       tool_call / tool_result are no-ops for the reducer; unknown SSE events dropped.

  Data sources (prompt list): useSettings + useTranslation + useAiStream. The component body itself
  reads only useTranslation + useAiStream; `useSettings` is the deterministic Safety-settings page
  list (baseline, AI-off-usable) which the `withAiFeature`/`useAiEnabled` gate consults — reproduced
  natively as the Availability tri-state (loading/failed/resolved(enabled:)).

